      {%- comment -%}
        COD reassurance sits ABOVE the button on purpose (re-applied 2026-08-19).
        Report §12: "Move the COD line and the 20/40 MAD figure above the
        Add-to-Cart button — COD is the decisive trust factor for first-time
        Moroccan buyers." The 20/40 figure is already above (.pdp-ship-line);
        this line was not — it rendered underneath, i.e. after the decision.
        The door-inspection clause matches /pages/faq and /pages/refund-policy
        in substance; nothing new is promised. aria-describedby still resolves.
