        <div class="tp-card"><b>الملاحظات</b><span>{% if flaw_note != blank %}{{ flaw_note }}{% elsif condition_confirmed %}راجع الوصف والصور الحقيقية؛ ما كايناش ملاحظة عيب منفصلة مسجلة فهاد الحقل.{% else %}ما غاديش نعرضو ملاحظة غير مؤكدة.{% endif %}</span></div>
        <div class="tp-card"><b>القياسات</b><span>{% if measurement_note != blank %}{{ measurement_note }}{% else %}استعمل القياس المكتوب فالقطعة، وسول فالواتساب على القياسات بالسنتيمتر إلا ماكانوش ظاهرين.{% endif %}</span></div>
        <div class="tp-card"><b>الخامة/اللون</b><span>{% if material_note != blank or color_note != blank %}{% if material_note != blank %}{{ material_note }}{% endif %}{% if material_note != blank and color_note != blank %} · {% endif %}{% if color_note != blank %}{{ color_note }}{% endif %}{% else %}الخامة واللون كيبانو فالصور والوصف عند توفر المعلومة.{% endif %}</span></div>
        <div class="tp-card"><b>الصور</b><span>الصور هي الصور الحقيقية للقطعة بالضبط. نقدر نصيفطو صور إضافية فالواتساب.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pdp-help-row">
      <a class="pdp-help" href="https://wa.me/{{ wa_number }}?text={{ wa_msg_fit }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📏 سول على القياس</a>
      <a class="pdp-help" href="https://wa.me/{{ wa_number }}?text={{ wa_msg_cond }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">🔍 تأكد من الحالة</a>
      <a class="pdp-help" href="https://wa.me/{{ wa_number }}?text={{ wa_msg_photos }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📷 طلب صور أكثر</a>
      <a class="pdp-help" href="https://wa.me/{{ wa_number }}?text={{ wa_msg_availability }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">✓ تأكد من التوفر</a>
    </div>

    <details class="acc" open>
      <summary>الحالة والتّيكيت</summary>
      <div class="acc-body">
        <b style="color:var(--gold2)">{{ condition_label }}</b><br>{{ condition_description }}
        {% if condition_notes != blank %}<br><br><b style="color:var(--cream)">ملاحظات الفحص:</b> {{ condition_notes }}{% endif %}
        {% if visible_defects != blank %}<br><br><b style="color:var(--cream)">الملاحظات الظاهرة:</b> {{ visible_defects }}{% endif %}
        {% unless condition_confirmed %}<br><br><b style="color:#ffad8c">هاد المنتج ماشي متوفر للطلب دابا.</b>{% endunless %}
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="acc" open>
      <summary>القياس والـ fit</summary>
      <div class="acc-body">{% if fit_note != blank %}<b style="color:var(--gold2)">{{ fit_note }}</b><br>{% endif %}{% if measurement_note != blank %}{{ measurement_note }}<br><br>{% endif %}راجع القياس المكتوب فهاد الصفحة قبل الطلب. إلا بغيتي تتأكد أكثر، صيفط لينا فـ WhatsApp ونعاونوك تشوف واش القياس مناسب ليك.</div>
    </details>

    <details class="acc">
      <summary>التوصيل والدفع</summary>
      <div class="acc-body">كنوصلو لمختلف المدن فالمغرب. تقدر تخلص عند الاستلام حسب الخيارات المتوفرة فالدفع. المدة والكلفة كيتأكدو حسب المدينة قبل الإرسال؛ التفاصيل الكاملة فـ <a href="/pages/shipping-and-payment">صفحة التوصيل والدفع</a>.</div>
    </details>

    <details class="acc">
      <summary>الإرجاع والتبديل</summary>
      <div class="acc-body">الإرجاع أو التبديل كيتطبق غير حسب <a href="/pages/refund-policy">السياسة المنشورة</a> وحالة القطعة. إلا عندك سؤال قبل الطلب، تواصل معنا فـ <a class="pdp-email" href="mailto:contact@lbassoriginal.com">contact@lbassoriginal.com</a> أو فالواتساب.</div>
    </details>

    <details class="acc">
      <summary>علاش Lbass Original؟</summary>
      <div class="acc-body">Lbass Original كيجمع ليك قطع branded second-hand وstreetwear مختارة، بصور حقيقية ديال نفس القطعة وحالة واضحة. الهدف هو تشري قطعة مختلفة وأنت فاهم شنو غادي يوصلك؛ الفحص داخلي وماشي شهادة خارجية إلا كانت مذكورة صراحة.</div>
    </details>
  </section>

  {% comment %}
    ═══ PRODUCT DESCRIPTION — added 2026-08-05 ═══

    This template did NOT render {{ product.description }} anywhere. Verified by
    grepping the whole 97KB file: zero occurrences. Every accordion above is
    built from metafields, and the boilerplate inside them is IDENTICAL on all
    40 products — so each PDP carried effectively no unique prose. That is a
    real ranking problem: Google had almost nothing page-specific to index
    beyond the title, and anything an owner typed into the Admin description box
    was silently discarded on the storefront.

    Same failure family as templates/page.pseo.liquid, which likewise ignored
    {{ page.content }} and made every Admin body edit inert.

    Gated on `!= blank` so products without a description render nothing rather
    than an empty box. The description is where per-product FAQ <details> live,
    which is what makes the FAQPage schema at the bottom of this file legitimate
    — visible question, matching answer.
  {% endcomment %}
  {% assign visible_product_description = product.description %}
  {% case product.handle %}
    {% when 'uniqlo-beige-open-collar-shirt' %}
      {% assign visible_product_description = visible_product_description | replace: 'حالة مزيانة بزاف - تحتاج تأكيد نهائي', 'بحالة ممتازة · شبه جديد' %}
    {% when 'adidas-track-pants-black-red', 'jordan-23-engineered-pants' %}
      {% assign visible_product_description = visible_product_description | replace: 'مستعمل — حالة ممتازة', 'بحالة مزيانة بزاف' %}
    {% when 'new-balance-cargo-pants-sage' %}
      {% assign visible_product_description = visible_product_description | replace: 'مستعمل — حالة ممتازة، ما فيه عيوب', 'ما فيهاش التّيكيت · بحالة ممتازة وشبه جديدة، والملاحظات كيبانو فوق' %}
  {% endcase %}
  {% if visible_product_description != blank and condition_confirmed %}
  <section class="pdp-body" aria-label="تفاصيل القطعة">
    {{ visible_product_description }}
  </section>
  {% elsif visible_product_description != blank %}
  <section class="pdp-body" aria-label="حالة المحتوى">
    <h2>تفاصيل القطعة خاصها مراجعة</h2>
    <p>الوصف القديم مخبي فهاد النسخة حتى يأكد صاحب المتجر الحالة والتّيكيت، باش ما يبان حتى ادعاء متناقض أو غير مؤكد.</p>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  {% comment %}
    ═══ CATEGORY / BRAND LINKS — added 2026-08-05 ═══
    Product pages had exactly ONE internal link to a collection (the breadcrumb),
    so they were near dead ends: crawl equity arrived and had nowhere to go, and
    category pages got no support from the products that belong to them. Since
    stock is 1/1 and sells out, the category pages are what has to rank over
    time — they need these links more than the products do.

    Built from the product's own collections, so anchors are always accurate and
    never invented. Junk buckets are excluded via the same list as the breadcrumb.
  {% endcomment %}
  {%- assign link_count = 0 -%}
  {%- capture collection_links -%}
    {%- for c in product.collections -%}
      {%- unless bc_junk contains c.handle -%}
        <a href="{{ c.url }}">{{ c.title }}</a>
        {%- assign link_count = link_count | plus: 1 -%}
      {%- endunless -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}
  {% if link_count > 0 %}
  <nav class="pdp-cats" aria-label="أقسام مرتبطة">
    <p class="pdp-cats-h">شوف تان قطع بحال هادي 👇</p>
    {{ collection_links }}
  </nav>
  {% endif %}

  {% comment %}
    كمّل اللوك — Lbass Look Builder.
    Selection order:
      1. Manual picks from the lbass.look_products metafield (sold items skipped).
      2. Complementary-category fallback: a top gets bottoms + shoes + accessories,
         bottoms get tops + shoes, etc. Available products only, never the current one.
      3. If fewer than 2 slots filled, pad with any other available piece.
  {% endcomment %}
  {% assign avail_pool = collections.all.products | where: 'available', true %}
  {% assign my_tags = product.tags | join: ',' | downcase %}
  {% assign my_type = product.type | downcase %}
  {% assign my_cat = 'top' %}
  {% if my_type contains 'shoe' or my_tags contains 'shoes' or my_tags contains 'slides' or my_tags contains 'sneaker' or my_tags contains 'flip' %}
    {% assign my_cat = 'shoes' %}
  {% elsif my_type contains 'pant' or my_type contains 'jean' or my_type contains 'sets' or my_tags contains 'pants' or my_tags contains 'cargo' or my_tags contains 'jeans' or my_tags contains 'shorts' %}
    {% assign my_cat = 'bottom' %}
  {% elsif my_type contains 'accessor' or my_tags contains 'cap' or my_tags contains 'bag' or my_tags contains 'accessor' %}
    {% assign my_cat = 'acc' %}
  {% endif %}
  {% case my_cat %}
    {% when 'bottom' %}{% assign want = 'top,shoes,acc' %}
    {% when 'shoes' %}{% assign want = 'bottom,top,acc' %}
    {% when 'acc' %}{% assign want = 'top,bottom,shoes' %}
    {% else %}{% assign want = 'bottom,shoes,acc' %}
  {% endcase %}
  {% assign want_arr = want | split: ',' %}
  {% assign picked = ',' %}
  {% assign look_count = 0 %}

  <section class="pdp-reviews lbass-reviews" aria-labelledby="reviews-h" dir="rtl">
    <header class="lbass-reviews__head">
      <p class="lbass-reviews__eyebrow" aria-hidden="true">LBASS COMMUNITY PROOF</p>
      <h2 class="lbass-reviews__title" id="reviews-h"><span aria-hidden="true">★</span> آراء الزبناء</h2>
      <p class="lbass-reviews__subtitle">شريتي من Lbass Original؟ رأيك كيعاون ناس آخرين يعرفو الحالة، القياس، والتجربة قبل ما يطلبو.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="lbass-reviews__topics" aria-label="شنو تقدر تذكر فالرأي ديالك">
      <span>الحالة</span><span>القياس</span><span>الصور</span><span>التوصيل</span><span>تجربة الطلب</span>
    </div>
    <p class="lbass-reviews__guide">قول للناس واش القياس جا مضبوط، واش الحالة كانت بحال الصور، وكيف كانت تجربة التوصيل.</p>
    <!-- Start of Judge.me code -->{% assign has_legacy = false %}{% if product.metafields.judgeme.widget.size > 20 %}{% assign has_legacy = true %}{% endif %}<div style='clear:both'></div><div id='judgeme_product_reviews' class='jdgm-widget jdgm-review-widget' data-product-title='{{ product.title | escape }}' data-id='{{ product.id }}' data-product-id='{{ product.id }}' data-widget='review' data-auto-install='false' data-shop-reviews-count='{{ shop.metafields.judgeme.shop_reviews_count | default: 0 | escape }}' data-entry-point='review_widget.js' data-entry-key='review-widget/main.js'>{% if has_legacy %}<div class='jdgm-legacy-widget-content' style='display: none;'>{{ product.metafields.judgeme.widget }}</div>{% endif %}</div>{% if product.metafields.judgeme.review_widget_data %}<script>jdgm.data ||= {}; jdgm.data.reviewWidget ||= {}; jdgm.data.reviewWidget[{{ product.id }}] = {{ product.metafields.judgeme.review_widget_data }}</script>{% endif %}<!-- End of Judge.me code -->
    <p class="lbass-reviews__trust"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span> رأيك خاص يكون حقيقي ومبني على تجربة الشراء.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="pdp-rel" aria-labelledby="rel-h">
    <h2 class="pdp-rel-h" id="rel-h">كمّل اللوك — شوف شنو يجي مع هاد القطعة 👇</h2>
    <p class="look-sub">قطع مختارة كيركبو مع هاد القطعة — وكلهم متوفرين دابا.</p>
    <div class="pgrid" id="lookGrid">
      {% comment %} 1 · manual merchandising via metafield {% endcomment %}
      {% assign look_manual = product.metafields.lbass.look_products.value %}
      {% if look_manual %}
        {% for lp in look_manual %}
          {% if lp.available and lp.id != product.id and look_count < 3 %}
            {% capture pid %},{{ lp.id }},{% endcapture %}
            {% unless picked contains pid %}
              {% assign picked = picked | append: lp.id | append: ',' %}
              {% assign look_count = look_count | plus: 1 %}
              {% render 'lbass-look-card', rp: lp %}
            {% endunless %}
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
      {% comment %} 2 · complementary-category fallback {% endcomment %}
      {% for slot_cat in want_arr %}
        {% if look_count >= 3 %}{% break %}{% endif %}
        {% for cp in avail_pool %}
          {% if cp.id == product.id %}{% continue %}{% endif %}
          {% capture pidm %},{{ cp.id }},{% endcapture %}
          {% if picked contains pidm %}{% continue %}{% endif %}
          {% assign cp_tags = cp.tags | join: ',' | downcase %}
          {% assign cp_type = cp.type | downcase %}
          {% assign cp_cat = 'top' %}
          {% if cp_type contains 'shoe' or cp_tags contains 'shoes' or cp_tags contains 'slides' or cp_tags contains 'sneaker' or cp_tags contains 'flip' %}
            {% assign cp_cat = 'shoes' %}
          {% elsif cp_type contains 'pant' or cp_type contains 'jean' or cp_type contains 'sets' or cp_tags contains 'pants' or cp_tags contains 'cargo' or cp_tags contains 'jeans' or cp_tags contains 'shorts' %}
            {% assign cp_cat = 'bottom' %}
          {% elsif cp_type contains 'accessor' or cp_tags contains 'cap' or cp_tags contains 'bag' or cp_tags contains 'accessor' %}
            {% assign cp_cat = 'acc' %}
          {% endif %}
          {% if cp_cat == slot_cat %}
            {% assign picked = picked | append: cp.id | append: ',' %}
            {% assign look_count = look_count | plus: 1 %}
            {% render 'lbass-look-card', rp: cp %}
            {% break %}
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      {% endfor %}
      {% comment %} 3 · pad with any available piece if fewer than 2 {% endcomment %}
      {% if look_count < 2 %}
        {% for cp in avail_pool %}
          {% if look_count >= 3 %}{% break %}{% endif %}
          {% if cp.id == product.id %}{% continue %}{% endif %}
          {% capture pidm %},{{ cp.id }},{% endcapture %}
          {% if picked contains pidm %}{% continue %}{% endif %}
          {% assign picked = picked | append: cp.id | append: ',' %}
          {% assign look_count = look_count | plus: 1 %}
          {% render 'lbass-look-card', rp: cp %}
        {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% if look_count > 0 and product.available and condition_confirmed %}
    <div class="look-all">
      <button type="button" class="look-all-btn" id="lookAddAll" data-look-count="{{ look_count }}">
        🛍 زيد هاد القطعة والقطع المؤكدة من اللوك للسلة
      </button>
      <p class="look-all-note">💵 كتخلّص غير ملي توصلك · راجع المخزون فصفحة كل قطعة</p>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  {% comment %}
    Related discovery cross-sell. This deliberately does not say "customers
    also bought": no verified order-pair dataset is available in Liquid, so
    that wording would invent social proof. Merchants can curate the first
    slots with lbass.related_products; the fallback is explainable and uses
    same-brand, same-type, then other in-stock products. Look-builder picks are
    excluded so the two modules do different jobs.
  {% endcomment %}
  {% assign related_picked = picked %}
  {% assign related_count = 0 %}
  {% capture related_cards %}
    {% assign related_manual = product.metafields.lbass.related_products.value %}
    {% if related_manual %}
      {% for rp in related_manual %}
        {% if rp.available and rp.id != product.id and related_count < 4 %}
          {% capture related_pid %},{{ rp.id }},{% endcapture %}
          {% unless related_picked contains related_pid %}
            {% assign related_picked = related_picked | append: rp.id | append: ',' %}
            {% assign related_count = related_count | plus: 1 %}
            {% render 'lbass-look-card', rp: rp %}
          {% endunless %}
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    {% endif %}

    {% for rp in avail_pool %}
      {% if related_count >= 4 %}{% break %}{% endif %}
      {% if rp.id == product.id or rp.vendor != product.vendor %}{% continue %}{% endif %}
      {% capture related_pid %},{{ rp.id }},{% endcapture %}
      {% if related_picked contains related_pid %}{% continue %}{% endif %}
      {% assign related_picked = related_picked | append: rp.id | append: ',' %}
      {% assign related_count = related_count | plus: 1 %}
      {% render 'lbass-look-card', rp: rp %}
    {% endfor %}

    {% if product.type != blank %}
      {% for rp in avail_pool %}
        {% if related_count >= 4 %}{% break %}{% endif %}
        {% if rp.id == product.id or rp.type != product.type %}{% continue %}{% endif %}
        {% capture related_pid %},{{ rp.id }},{% endcapture %}
        {% if related_picked contains related_pid %}{% continue %}{% endif %}
        {% assign related_picked = related_picked | append: rp.id | append: ',' %}
        {% assign related_count = related_count | plus: 1 %}
        {% render 'lbass-look-card', rp: rp %}
      {% endfor %}
    {% endif %}

    {% for rp in avail_pool %}
      {% if related_count >= 4 %}{% break %}{% endif %}
      {% if rp.id == product.id %}{% continue %}{% endif %}
      {% capture related_pid %},{{ rp.id }},{% endcapture %}
      {% if related_picked contains related_pid %}{% continue %}{% endif %}
      {% assign related_picked = related_picked | append: rp.id | append: ',' %}
      {% assign related_count = related_count | plus: 1 %}
      {% render 'lbass-look-card', rp: rp %}
    {% endfor %}
  {% endcapture %}
  {% if related_count > 0 %}
    <section class="pdp-rel pdp-rel--discovery" aria-labelledby="related-discovery-h">
      <p class="pdp-rel-kicker">KEEP DISCOVERING</p>
